  1007                              <1> .cpsWildcard:
  1008                              <1> ;Fill the entire FCB filespec with ?'s.
  1009                              <1> ;We lookahead to the first char past the final "*" to prevent multiple
  1010                              <1> ; *'s from crashing DOS :)
