   413                              <1> ; the strings down far enough to make space for the var.
   414                              <1> .sevDoMake:
   415                              <1> ;Here we create the environment variable. We start by moving the 
   416                              <1> ; args block down by one dVarLen amount. We know we have this space
   417                              <1> ; free to us.
