   491                              <1> .getLaunchParams:
   492                              <1> ;Copies the data in cmdLineArgPtr to the location specified by them and 
   493                              <1> ; also parses the argument list into an .
   494                              <1> ;This allows me to move it out of the PSP if needed later.
