   499                              <1> scanPathWC:
   500                              <1> ;Scans a path for wildcards. Used in cases where wildcards cannot be permitted
   501                              <1> ; even in the final path componant.
   502                              <1> ;Input: rsi = Pointer to the ASCIIZ filename
